nt is in the finance category, entities are present, and the response is conversational.\n'}, 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 26512594627, 'load_duration': 104239324, 'prompt_eval_count': 626, 'prompt_eval_duration': 4863459681, 'eval_count': 437, 'eval_duration': 21202600499}
