 value. But the user didn\'t specify the value, so maybe just the symbol. \n\nPutting it all together, the JSON should have all these fields. Let me check again. Yes, the workspace is finance, entities are company and symbol, parameters empty, etc. The response is a friendly message, and the reason is the classification.\n'}, 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 29302027926, 'load_duration': 1455368684, 'prompt_eval_count': 626, 'prompt_eval_duration': 4175813755, 'eval_count': 496, 'eval_duration': 23281009957}
