cation is straightforward. Since it\'s a financial inquiry, the workspace is finance. The response is a simple statement, and the reason is clear.\n\nPutting it all together, the JSON should have all these fields. Let me check again. Yes, the intent is actionable, domain is finance, entities are TSLA, parameters maybe symbol, reason is clear. All fields filled.\n'}, 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 24418279725, 'load_duration': 111425933, 'prompt_eval_count': 634, 'prompt_eval_duration': 70822988, 'eval_count': 506, 'eval_duration': 23861999549}
