t\'s all. Let me structure the JSON accordingly.\n'}, 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 21070726698, 'load_duration': 109094920, 'prompt_eval_count': 634, 'prompt_eval_duration': 61325891, 'eval_count': 443, 'eval_duration': 20564148037}
